{
  "slug": "xsolla-ai-kit",
  "name": "Xsolla Ai Kit",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Xsolla agent skills toolkit — guided, end-to-end workflows for merchant setup, catalog design, Login/NewID, Pay Station, webhooks, storefront build, and shop branding, calling Xsolla REST APIs directly.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **8 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (8): `catalog-design` (Configures the Xsolla catalog for a game and wires the full sell-side flow: virtual items, virtual currency and…), `headless-checkout-integration` (Integrates Xsolla Headless Checkout — a fully customizable, client-controlled payment UI built on the @xsolla/pay-station-sdk JavaScript SDK, where…), `login-setup` (Integrates Xsolla Login (a.k.a), `login-styling` (Applies a custom visual style / theme / brand to the Xsolla Login widget (Login Widget 2.0, `@xsolla/login-sdk`)…), `merchant-setup` (Guide for setting up a new Xsolla merchant account and obtaining API credentials), `production` (Takes an Xsolla headless shop from sandbox to live production payments — licensing agreement, tax interview, flipping sandbox…), `shop-setup` (Orchestrator and entry point for building a complete Xsolla Headless Shop — an AI-assembled storefront from Login +…), `webhooks-impl` (Implements and validates the backend that receives Xsolla webhooks for a headless web shop — server-to-server notifications for…)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `xsolla-docs`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install xsolla-ai-kit@claude-community` from `xsolla/xsolla-ai-kit`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
